  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Lalit Chandrakant Madhavi vs The State Of Maharashtra on 8 March, 2022 Author: C.V. Bhadang Bench: C.V. Bhadang 15 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Cri. Anticipatory Bail Application No. 650 Of 2020 Lalit Chandrakant Madhavi ..Applica Vs. The State of Maharashtra ..Respond ---- Ms. Keral Mehta, for the Applicant. Mr. S. R. Agarkar, App for the Respondent / State. Digitally Mamta signed by Mamta Amar Kale ---- Amar Date: Kale 2022.03.09",
    "facts": "2. The Applicant, apprehending arrest, in connection with investigation of Crime No.14/2020 of Police Station Karkamb, District Solapur (Rural), under Section 59, 3(1)(a), 3(1)(zz)(v), 26(1), 26(2)(i), 26(2)(v) and 27(3)(e) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and Section 328, 188, 272 and 273 r/w. 34 of Lalit Chandrakant Madhavi vs The State Of Maharashtra on 8 March, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/149246418/ 1 IPC, is seeking anticipatory bail. Mamta Kale page 15-aba-650-2020.doc 3. According to the informant, from 10 January 2020 to 11 January 2020, in a raid conducted at Shree Ram Milk Collection Centre of the co-accused Dattatray Mahadeo Jadhav at Sugaon Bhuse, Tehsil Pandharpur, District Solapur, following articles for manufacturing of artificial milk were recovered. (i) Whole Milk Powder 956 Packets of 500 gms each. (ii) Whey Permeate Powder 50 Bags of 25 Kgs each. (iii) Lactose Powder 33 Bags (iv) Liquid Paraffin 1 Barrel of 1258 Litres. (v) Sorbitol 1 Barrel of 1298 Litres. (vi) Melamine 3 Bags of 51 Kgs. each The aforesaid articles were worth Rs.4,02,012/-. According to the informant, the aforesaid articles were stored by the co-accused Dattatray Mahadeo Jadhav for manufacture of artificial milk / adulteration of the milk. 4. The allegation in so far as the present Applicant is concerned, is that he had sold Melamine powder to the co-accused Dattatray Mahadeo Jadhav without issuance of any bill / invoice. 6. The learned APP submitted that the investigation is complete and the chargesheet is filed. The recovery from the co- accused Dattatray Mahadeo Jadhav has already been made.",
    "arguments": "5. The learned counsel for the Applicant submitted that the wife of the Applicant namely Ms. Latika Lalit Madhavi is having an establishment by name M/s. Mody Chem for conducting the Mamta Kale page 2 of 4 15-aba-650-2020.doc business of chemical trading. It is submitted that there are no bills / invoices produced to show that it was the Applicant who had supplied Melamine to the co-accused Dattatray Mahadeo Jadhav. It is submitted that no such adulterating material is recovered from the Applicant.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "5. The learned counsel for the Applicant submitted that the wife of the Applicant namely Ms. Latika Lalit Madhavi is having an establishment by name M/s. Mody Chem for conducting the Mamta Kale page 2 of 4 15-aba-650-2020.doc business of chemical trading. It is submitted that there are no bills / invoices produced to show that it was the Applicant who had supplied Melamine to the co-accused Dattatray Mahadeo Jadhav. It is submitted that no such adulterating material is recovered from the Applicant.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
